// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1021899148" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown>I have seen ENOUGH! You people have NO RIGHT to treat Penny this way.<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown>You have the HONOR of being in the presence of the greatest mind the world has seen, and you think to BERATE her?<t=3 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown>She deserves BETTER!<t=3 caption x= 0.5 y=0.25 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown>She deserves RESPECT!<t=2 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown>She deserves...<t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.35 d=4><scale 3><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown><b>ME."
