// Script Variable SaysList :
"P272863868" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown> {HeroName}, it is unfortunate that you managed to track me here.<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown>I will give you this one warning: leave now, before I am forced to take drastic action against you.<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color #CDCCCC><bgcolor #601014>Hey! Are you threatening my teammate? I'm TALKING here!<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown>No, wait, Penny... I didn't mean to-."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P316332817" "<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color #CDCCCC><bgcolor #601014>Yo {HeroName}, I know you're, ah, just doing your job here. But... this is kind of a delicate situation, and I'm not sure Russell is entirely stable right now...<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown>You hear that, {HeroName}? Penny doesn't want you here. No one wants you here, so just LEAVE."
