"P4123474112" "<t 3><color white><bgcolor saddlebrown>I don't want to lose you, Penelope. You're all I have left. My little... my little princess.<t 0>I'm done, {HeroName}. I'll leave you and the Freedom Phalanx alone... for the moment. For now, I believe we have a truce."
