// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NuminaTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3798013623" "<color orange>Numina appears to be fading in and out of consciousness. You're not sure how the Trolls were capable of harming her, given her generally incorporeal nature. Still, somehow they were able to overpower her."
// Answer Text :
"P3785407587" "(Activate Numina's Medi-porter)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2743593490" "<color orange>Numina's eyes flutter open as you activate her medical teleporter. She looks at you and manages a weak smile before being transported to a safe location."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PositronTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P649951394" "<color orange>Positron looks battered, and his sections of his armor appear to have been torn open.</color><br><br>{HeroName}... it's good to see you. We were ambushed... while pursuing the Clockwork. The Trolls far exceeded my predictions.<br><br>This is highly abnormal, {HeroName}. I've never known Superadine to grant this much power to a person. Something else appears to be affecting them... <i>empowering</i> them."
// Answer Text :
"P1115033575" "We can address that later. You need medical attention."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1148104897" "<color orange>Positron nods, and activates his medi-porter.</color><br><br>You're right, of course. I'll leave the Trolls to you, {HeroName}. Good luck."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3446021100" "It appears that we have a problem, {HeroName}. While pursuing the Clockwork in Skyway City, it appears that Positron and Numina encountered a large group of Trolls on a rampage, and... well, it appears that they were overwhelmed.<br><br>Now, I haven't been active in Paragon for decades, but something smells fishy about this to me. If you ask me, two members of the most prominent supergroup in the city should be able to handle a few drugged-up hooligans.<br><br><color orange>Wavelength lets out a mild sigh.</color><br><br>But what do I know, dear? My glory days are long gone, and if these Trolls are enough of a danger to threaten the Phalanx, then they're going to need assistance. I know it's a bother, but could I send you to Skyway to see if you could help?"
// AcceptString :
"P3326286376" "I'll head there immediately."
// SendOffString :
"P2926487998" "Thank you, dear, but I can get you there faster. I've called in transportation from the Freedom Corps, so as soon as you're ready to go they can take you directly to the scene. From the reports I'm getting, it doesn't seem you'll have to look far to find the Trolls."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3269134685" "Stop the Troll Rampage"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2521040079" "I don't think this is a good time for a chat, {HeroName}. Lives <i>are</i> at stake, you know."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P292636899" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Problem?</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1145010024" "Wavelength wasn't kidding. The Trolls are out in force today."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3299984834" "Rescue Numina"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3542312994" "Rescue Positron"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2250840745" "Make sure Numina is alright"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3702812844" "Make sure Positron is alright"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P72031957" "What is strength? Why is strong better?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P780733454" "<t 1><t 0>Strong... live. Strong live, weak die."
// Script Variable ACTOR1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P299246202" "This new Supes is good stuff!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1290237618" "<t 1><t 0>It not Supes, it something else. More... pure."
// Script Variable ACTOR1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2381914808" "Trolls strong! Atta strongest!"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P299990172" "We show you! Stronger than before!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P73076781" "They shouldn't... be able to..."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3719180195" "Even ghost lady get punched. Me strong!"
// Script Variable BOSS_2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2813646935" "You be easier to smash than ghost lady!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3104559809" "<color #BB99AA><bgcolor #660F68><bordercolor #BB99AA>I am... most grateful."

