"P3479199711" "This isn't good... my suit's systems are failing..."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P959666966" "Tin man smash easy! You go squish now!"
// Script Variable BOSS_2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3455360107" "More heroes to crush!"
