// Dialog :
"P537464209" "You have defeated Atta, and scattered his rampaging Troll horde."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P171249106" "Thank you for your timely intervention, {HeroName}. It's reassuring to know that some young Heroes today have the drive to do what's right, no matter what odds they face. I must admit, I've been disappointed in the performance of the Phalanx of late, but I suppose that's to be expected, given what they've been through, recently."
// RandomFameString :
"P22228287" "If Superadine can make you so strong, why don't Heroes ever use it? You'd think one of them would give it a try..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PositronTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page PickOne Text :
"P3065911067" "If these energy signatures are appearing in Atlas Park, we're going to need someone to investigate.<br><br>{HeroName}, your prior success against the Trolls in Skyway suggests that you may be capable of handling whatever's up there. Still, I think the Phalanx should have an official presence as well, if there is an attack imminent.<br><br>If you don't mind, I'd like you to select a member of our team to accompany you on your patrol."
// Answer Text :
"P828631060" "Why not bring the whole team?"
// Answer Text :
"P1800500833" "Agreed."
// Answer Text :
"P3622549640" "I work better alone, Positron."
// Page BringEveryone Text :
"P1206301519" "That would improve our odds were something dangerous to occur, true. However, given the relative frequency of these anomalies, I believe that holding the majority of the team in reserve is the most prudent course of action.<br><br>If more anomalies reveal themselves, I will send members to investigate. If not, then we may join you shortly to assist in your investigation."
// Answer Text :
"P890882007" "Very well. I'll select a partner then."
// Answer Text :
"P3665109797" "I think I can handle myself, if that's your concern."
// Page GonnaPick Text :
"P202352706" "Thank you, {HeroName}. You've more than proven your capabilities to me, and I'm sure any of the Phalanx would be honored to work with you."
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page ByMyself Text :
"P2505180845" "<color orange>Positron appears to ponder your response for a moment.</color><br><br>...Are you absolutely sure, {HeroName}? You're not an official part of the Phalanx, and I can't force you to work with us directly.<br><br>However, I worry that we are confronting a force that we have yet to understand. If something is capable of propelling the Trolls to such astronomical levels of strength..."
// Answer Text :
"P3249655240" "Hm, I see your point. I suppose I can take on a partner."
// Answer Text :
"P2034051543" "No need to worry, Positron. I'll be fine."
// Page ByMyself2 Text :
"P3798819571" "Very well, then.<br><br><color orange>Positron nods to you solemnly.</color><br><br>We'll be watching your progress from here, {HeroName}. Good luck."
// Page PickMe Text :
"P3220281620" "Have you chosen a partner yet, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P3761496805" "Why don't you work with me on this one, Positron?"
// Answer Text :
"P3717672412" "Not yet."
// Page ChooseYou Text :
"P576323820" "<color orange>Positron appears hesitant.</color><br><br>Hm... I had intended to monitor the situation, and to supervise you if necessary. Still, I don't suppose there's any harm in getting more directly involved.<br><br>I'm with you, {HeroName}. Meet me outside and we can begin our investigation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CitadelTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1870807966" "{HeroName}. I have been observing your work since Positron requested your assistance, and the majority of your actions have had highly positive impacts on the stability of Paragon City.<br><br>If it is your intent to investigate the energy sources we have detected in Atlas Park, I would be greatly interested in accompanying you."
// Answer Text :
"P28833993" "Of course, Citadel."
// Answer Text :
"P2233658701" "Give me a moment to think about it."
// Page ChooseYou Text :
"P3887106096" "<color orange>Citadel's mesh exterior begins to crackle with energy.</color><br><br>Excellent. I will begin preparations immediately. As soon as I am finished, I will join you outside the entrance to Fort Trident."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BackAlleyBrawlerTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3074776855" "Hey, kid. Pretty good work out there.<br><br>I gotta admit, when Positron first said he was going to call you in for help, I was a little suspicious. I've been tight with the Phalanx for a long time, but you don't have that kind of history.<br><br>Pos showed me your credentials, though, and he's said you worked with some of 'em before... and now here you are, bringing home the prize twice in a row. Not what I expected, not at all."
// Answer Text :
"P75334173" "Care to help me try for prize number three?"
// Answer Text :
"P1572349116" "Uh, thanks... I think."
// Page ChooseYou Text :
"P3220859688" "<color orange>Back Alley Brawler grins at you. He makes to crack his knuckles, but thanks to his armored gauntlets, all you hear is the sound of groaning metal.</color><br><br>I was hoping you'd ask me that. Hearing about the problems in Skyway got my blood pumping. I haven't had a <b><i>real</b></i> fight in months.<br><br>I'll catch you topside. We'll see if this investigation turns up anything... exciting."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PenelopeYinTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Friendly Text :
"P3045619986" "<color orange>Penelope smiles at you as you approach.</color><br><br>Hey there, {Hero.gender=male tough guy|girlfriend}. Thanks again for your help with the Clockwork King. I know most heroes don't care about why a bad guy does what he does, but in Russell's case, I really do think he's trying to be better. He just... doesn't fit in well with the rest of us, you know? He doesn't have a lot of respect for rules. I think he's starting to come around, though.<br><br>Anyway, I feel like I'm just rambling now. Did you need something?"
// Answer Text :
"P2635607703" "Positron's sending me topside. Care to join me?"
// Answer Text :
"P830247590" "No, not really. Just catching up."
// Page Friendly2 Text :
"P3400286890" "<color orange>Penelope beams at you.</color><br><br>Absolutely! Give me a second to get ready, and then I'll meet you in Prometheus Park.<br><br>This will be fun!"
// Page Angry Text :
"P1568608139" "<color orange>Penelope glances at you out of the corner of her eye, then turns back to Numina angrily.</color><br><br>Say, Tammy, you've known {HeroName} longer than I have. Do you think {Hero.gender=male he's|she's} capable of actual empathy? Because I'm not sure {Hero.gender=male he|she} even recognizes that the 'bad guys' {Hero.gender=male he|she} clobbers are, y'know, <b><i>actual people</b></i>. What do YOU think?"
// Answer Text :
"P2661589512" "Cute, Penelope. Come on, Positron's given us an assignment."
// Answer Text :
"P412024825" "Ugh. I don't need this now."
// Page Angry2 Text :
"P1253863678" "<color orange>Penelope glares at you.</color><br><br>Oh, so I get to work with our resident contracted sociopath? Fantastic! I bet we'll have a grand old time <b><i>shooting at anything that moves</i></b>.<br><br><color orange>Penelope rolls her eyes, and lets out an overdramatic sigh.</color><br><br>Fine, then. Let's just get this over with."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NuminaTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4075721616" "Hello, {HeroName}. I must thank you for your assistance in Skyway City. I'm ashamed to admit, the Trolls' ability to cause me harm was a surprise. Thankfully, you arrived in time to prevent whatever cruel fate they had planned for me.<br><br>Still, I plan on being more cautious in the future. It seems that Paragon City is always defying our expectations."
// Answer Text :
"P1972808340" "That's why Positron has asked me to investigate. Care to join me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1606293878" "Glad I could help, Numina."
// Page ChooseYou Text :
"P947368980" "I would be glad to work with you on this, {HeroName}. Whatever is empowering the Trolls... I find it disturbing. The effects reached their very core, and gave them capabilities that go far beyond mere brute strength. I fear that we have only uncovered the barest fraction of the forces we are placed against.<br><br>I shall meet you above, and there, we will try to find some answers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ManticoreTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Friendly Text :
"P1960142124" "<color orange>Manticore nods to you respectfully.</color><br><br>{HeroName}. It's good to be working with you again. When Positron told the team that he was bringing in you and Brawler as outside help, I was flat-out against it. At a time like this, the Phalanx needs to show their strength, or the jackals will be all over us.<br><br>Now, though, I'm starting to reconsider. You handled the Clockwork King perfectly, and I think you sent a message to the rest of the team - 'If you want to stop a villain, this is how you do it.' You get things done... and I can respect that.<br><br><color orange>Manticore rolls his shoulders, and begins flexing the fingers on his bow hand.</color><br><br>So... are we heading out, then?"
// Answer Text :
"P2239534678" "As soon as you're ready."
// Answer Text :
"P3545589323" "Not yet. Give me some time to decide."
// Page Friendly2 Text :
"P2302769051" "<color orange>Manticore's mouth pulls into a predatory smile.</color><br><br>Excellent. The hunt begins.<br><br>Meet me topside, and come prepared for a fight. If this energy is being detected near City Hall, you can be sure something bad is about to go down."
// Page Angry Text :
"P4065751702" "<color orange>Manticore levels a grim stare at you.</color><br><br>You're soft, {HeroName}.<br><br>Now, I don't say that because I think you're not a good fighter. You've proven that you can handle yourself well enough. But you make poor decisions, and expose yourself <b>and</b> this city to unnecessary danger.<br><br>I mean, what were you thinking, that the Clockwork King was some misunderstood teenager? You let a dangerous psychic criminal run loose after he carried out a premeditated attack on a Freedom Phalanx facility, and for what? So that you wouldn't have to hurt his <b><i>feelings</b></i>?<br><br>The Clockwork King is not some child to be chided and then sent on his way. He is a <b><i>criminal</b></i> that is responsible for the deaths of more Paragon Citizens than you know."
// Answer Text :
"P1374467373" "Look, Manticore, are you with me on this or not?"
// Answer Text :
"P866102412" "Not in the mood for a lecture, Manticore. Maybe later."
// Page Angry2 Text :
"P2401009634" "Oh, you can bet on it. I'd be half-mad to let you take on this investigation solo. For all I know, you'd feel sorry for whoever's up there and let them kidnap the mayor.<br><br>Meet me topside, {HeroName}, and we'll begin. Just be sure you don't get in my way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SynapseTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P141087043" "<color orange>Synapse seems to be caught up in a one-way conversation with Back Alley Brawler.</color><br><br>So I said to her, 'Listen, honey, I know it sounds bad, but come on! You're twins. Identical twins. You can't blame me for this!'<br><br>I mean, yeah, she was pissed. But really, if I'm attracted to her sister, she should just take that as a compliment, right? If I like one, then obviously the other's going to...<br><br><color orange>Synapse seems to finally notice your presence, and ends his rant prematurely. He casually waves to you.</color><br><br>Yo, {HeroName}. Pretty slick moves, from what Pos and Numina are saying. What's up?"
// Answer Text :
"P2751733925" "Investigating City Hall. Want to come with?"
// Answer Text :
"P1971657295" "...Nevermind, Synapse. I can see that you're busy."
// Page ChooseYou Text :
"P1066778744" "I dunno, does a Warwolf have fangs? Heck <b><i>yes</b></i>, I'm coming with! I haven't seen any decent action since, uh... since States...<br><br><color orange>Synapse trails off, looking sheepish.</color><br><br>Sorry. Sometimes I talk before I think. Just... meet me up top, ok? I want to get some air anyway."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2206257288" "Positron just contacted me, {HeroName}. He'd like you to report to Fort Trident to debrief with his team. I imagine he's itching to find out what went wrong with his encounter with those Trolls.<br><br>I know the Phalanx has been leaning on you quite a bit recently, but it would be good of you to respond. Give them time, {HeroName}. They will return to their former glory soon enough, you'll see."
// AcceptString :
"P2594736113" "I'll head over there now."
// SendOffString :
"P3901464347" "<color orange>Wavelength chuckles softly.</color><br><br>Always the lively one, eh, {HeroName}? I knew a Hero or two with your spark in my day, but not a one seemed as capable. Give my regards to Positron, will you?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3788923562" "<color deepskyblue>Part 3: The Clamor and the Clangor</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2415325089" "Rendezvous with the Freedom Phalanx"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2955104155" "Feeling weary, {HeroName}. I understand, dear. It's a thankless job. Still, it's what we all signed up for, isn't it? You'd best be on your way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P521042462" "Things seem a bit calmer than the last time you were here."
