"P1304712967" "Meet with the Freedom Phalanx"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P3777178321" "The Freedom Phalanx"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P181832962" "Mission Exit"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P83189875" "Select an ally"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3974652483" "Investigate the area near City Hall"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P274529924" "Strange Disturbance"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3807549891" "Defeat Clamor!"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P844676393" "Clamor"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4027804" "Dude, these chicks are AWESOME!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2751673786" "<t 2><t 0>I know! All they ever do is break things!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1164127453" "Hey man, back off! We saw them first!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1817338133" "<t 4>So... what happened to Clam? She seems... different.<t 0>Psh... figures. Women."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3150630369" "<t 2><t 0>I dunno. Maybe her friends gave her a makeover or something?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3760988725" "Whoa, hey now. What do we have here?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2239332530" "I dunno, man. They're kind of... freaky."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2553450453" "<t 2><t 0>Are you hearing yourself? You just called someone ELSE a freak."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3624391792" "Yeah, yeah! Just shut up and help me with this nerd."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2442827055" "The metal ones do not share in our vision..."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P4163709096" "<t 2>They are tools, nothing more. Do not trouble yourself with their fate."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1022797246" "This one, however... this one can be removed."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3378511219" "These ones seem... easier to control than most."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1847158531" "<t 2>Their minds are simple. They admire our ways, though they do not understand."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2240425268" "Do you understand, 'hero'? Do you know our ways?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2692479650" "The metal woman's conversion was faster than expected."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1043334025" "<t 2>Her philosophy matches our own. Her mind was ripe for our message."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3356847707" "Foolish child. You do not know what forces affect this world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 0 Actor8 :
"P2418810225" "<Goto E9 f E1>"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P612701901" "<f E9>Ah, {HeroName}. My thanks again for your assistance in Skyway City."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2470034179" "<f E9>Those Trolls we encountered appear to have been bolstered by some unknown energy source."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P1197301971" "<color #6699bb><bgcolor #120f48><bordercolor #6699bb>We haven't been able to determine the source of the Trolls' newfound power, but..."
// 4 Actor2 :
"P458024001" "<color #6699bb><bgcolor #120f48><bordercolor #6699bb>Interesting... Dr. Keyes, you may want to see this."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P3264372328" "<f E2>What is it, Citadel?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P683967090" "<color #6699bb><bgcolor #120f48><bordercolor #6699bb>The system is currently detecting energy fluctuations similar to those seen in Skyway."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P203204094" "<color #6699bb><bgcolor #120f48><bordercolor #6699bb>They appear to be emanating... from the area around City Hall."
// 1 Actor1 :
"P3443676773" "Interesting indeed."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2074140272" "We're going to need someone to investigate. If you don't mind, I'd like you to select a member of our team to accompany you on your patrol."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2636929062" "Taking the whole team would improve our odds were something dangerous to occur, true. However, I believe that holding the majority of the team in reserve is the most prudent course of action."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1762350916" "...Are you absolutely sure, {HeroName}?I worry that we are confronting a force that we have yet to understand."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P559567250" "Very well, then. We'll be watching your progress from here, {HeroName}. Good luck."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3626924178" "I don't suppose there's any harm in getting directly involved. I'm with you, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P999451825" "<t 3>Hey, kid. Pretty good work out there. I gotta admit, when Positron first said he was going to call you in for help, I was a little suspicious.<t 0>But now here you are, bringing home the prize twice in a row. Not what I expected, not at all."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3324709925" "I was hoping you'd ask me that. I haven't had a real fight in months. I'll catch you topside."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P132057051" "<color #6699bb><bgcolor #120f48><bordercolor #6699bb>{HeroName}. If it is your intent to investigate the energy sources we have detected in Atlas Park, I would be greatly interested in accompanying you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P174356795" "<color #6699bb><bgcolor #120f48><bordercolor #6699bb>Excellent. I will begin preparations immediately. As soon as I am finished, I will join you outside the entrance to Fort Trident."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2468304755" "<color #BB99AA><bgcolor #660F68><bordercolor #BB99AA>Hello, {HeroName}. I must thank you for your assistance in Skyway City. I plan on being more cautious in the future. It seems that Paragon City is always defying our expectations."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3234350932" "<color #BB99AA><bgcolor #660F68><bordercolor #BB99AA>I would be glad to work with you on this, {HeroName}. I shall meet you above, and there, we will try to find some answers."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1475657128" "Yo, {HeroName}. Pretty slick moves, from what Pos and Numina are saying. What's up?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2514759303" "<t 3>Heck yes, I'm coming with! I haven't seen any decent action since, uh... since States...<t 0>Sorry. Sometimes I talk before I think. Just... meet me up top, ok? I want to get some air anyway."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P138924071" "{HeroName}. It's good to be working with you again. You handled the Clockwork King perfectly. You get things done... and I can respect that."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1659491501" "Excellent. The hunt begins. Meet me topside, and come prepared for a fight."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P819552715" "<t 3>You're soft, {HeroName}.What were you thinking, that the Clockwork King was some misunderstood teenager?<t 0>The Clockwork King is not some child to be chided and then sent on his way. He is a criminal that is responsible for the deaths of more Paragon Citizens than you know."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P651654904" "Meet me topside, {HeroName}, and we'll begin. Just be sure you don't get in my way."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P356752429" "Hey there, {Hero.gender=male tough guy|girlfriend}. Thanks again for your help with the Clockwork King. Did you need something?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1936137630" "Give me a second to get ready, and then I'll meet you in Prometheus Park. This will be fun!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P937767296" "<t 3>Say, Tammy, you've known {HeroName} longer than I have. Do you think {Hero.gender=male he's|she's} capable of actual empathy?<t 0>Because I'm not sure {Hero.gender=male he|she} even recognizes that the 'bad guys' {Hero.gender=male he|she} clobbers are, y'know, actual people. What do YOU think?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2504931242" "<t 3>Oh, so I get to work with our resident contracted sociopath? Fantastic! I bet we'll have a grand old time shooting at anything that moves.<t 0>Let's just get this over with."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P421636567" "Come quickly, {HeroName}. I believe that City Hall may be under attack!"
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2634181376" "<color #6699bb><bgcolor #120f48><bordercolor #6699bb>I do not believe we will need to look far, {HeroName}, given the circumstances."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2707311606" "<color #BB99AA><bgcolor #660F68><bordercolor #BB99AA>I do not like this... I sense a great power here."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1544124166" "Uh, {HeroName}? You'd better check this out."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2472042666" "Careful. I don't like the looks of this."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3188344000" "This is bad... very bad..."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1246816509" "Looks like we're gonna get some action after all, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2266420580" "<t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>Yes, YES!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2609064944" "<t=5 d=5><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>Bring the destruction, bring the carnage!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P985759837" "<t=5 d=5><color silver><bgcolor purple><bordercolor silver>Such a beautiful song! I must hear MORE!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P337629768" "Give me a hand here, {HeroName}, she won't go quietly!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 2 Actor8 :
"P3150339985" "<t=2 d=2 em wounded><color silver><bgcolor purple><bordercolor silver>Ugh..."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3874592372" "<t=5 d=5><color #6699bb><bgcolor #120f48><bordercolor #6699bb>Clamor appears to be affected by the same power source as Atta."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P4228401278" "<em thanks t=6 d=6>Then we'll need to take her back to Fort Trident. If we can analyze the energy source more closely..."
// 3 Actor6 :
"P1211256819" "No need for that. I'll just hop in and take a look..."
// 3 Actor7 :
"P1192613676" "<t=3 d=3 em laugh>Oh, this should be good."
// 3 Actor6 :
"P573837775" "<t=3 d=3>Got it!"
// 3 Actor6 :
"P1222418456" "<t=3 d=3>Clamor, why don't you tell the crowd what you've been up to?"
// 3 Actor8 :
"P2169509486" "<t=3 d=3><color silver><bgcolor purple><bordercolor silver>..."
// 5 Actor8 :
"P1975002074" "<t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>The time of chaos is at hand... all will be remade in the shape of power."
// 5 Actor8 :
"P3296288787" "<t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>You weak fools, who hoard power but fear its use... your time has ended."
// 4 Actor8 :
"P4212522533" "<t=4 d=4><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>Pandora's Box is opening."
// 3 Actor8 :
"P966395890" "<t=3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>The power must have a host..."
// 3 Actor8 :
"P1380876485" "<t=3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>...a vessel..."
// 5 Actor8 :
"P1879158417" "<t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>...a <b><i>Champion</b></i>."
// Script Variable Actor9_Name :
"P3062005348" "Player"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3289128670" "You have defeated Clamor, and learned something about her strange new power..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3605445844" "Pandora's Box... oh dear. That certainly doesn't sound good. You may want to keep this information amongst those you trust, {HeroName}. If word gets out that Paragon's criminal element is getting power enough to challenge its greatest champions, why, there'd by riots in the streets.<br><br>I will be frank, {HeroName}. I fear for the future. The world has been beset by more threats than the good citizens of this city would ever care to know, and by and large we've managed to survive until now because Statesman has led the way. With him gone... I do not know if the Phalanx is still up to the challenges ahead.<br><br>But... perhaps <i>you</i> are. I sincerely hope that is the case."

